    "features": "<p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Just a Shadow, Neurotoxin (2 SP)</p><p><strong>Neurotoxin (2 Sp):</strong> The death slug secretes coniine on a character it can touch. If the target’s skin is exposed, they must make a TN 17 Constitution (Tolerance) test or immediately enter respiratory failure. After a number of rounds equal to double their Constitution score, the character falls unconscious (see Suffocation).</p><p><strong>Slime Trail:</strong> The death slug leaves a thin mucus trail in its wake that is also faintly bioluminescent. The trail fades after 1d6 minutes.</p><p><strong>Vibration Sense:</strong> Lacking eyes or ears, the death slug senses movement based on vibration.</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 1</p>",
